{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e15-scene-22",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "确认所有人的安全  (Confirming Everyone's Safety)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After refusing to greenlight the travel show's broadcast until news of the overseas attacks is verified, Chun Yuqiao issues urgent orders from his office despite a painful stomach flare-up. Listen to their Mandarin exchange.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "联系大使馆，动用欧洲所有关系，我要第一时间知道那边的状况。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我们的速度一定要比国内的新闻行动更快。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "好，我马上去办。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "联系节目所有的合作艺人以及参与者，确认他们的现状。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一个也不能漏，不要只发信息。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我要听到他们亲自说话，或者见到他们本人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，你的胃又疼了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "给我拿一下药。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "小谷你留守公司，盯住今天的天气情况。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，我这就给你拿药。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你知道老大病发的时候最不想见人，咱们赶快行动吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "联系大使馆，动用欧洲所有关系，我要第一时间知道那边的状况。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Contact the embassy and mobilise every connection in Europe; I want to know the situation there firsthand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我们的速度一定要比国内的新闻行动更快。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our speed must outpace domestic news reports.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "好，我马上去办。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Understood, I will get right on it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "联系节目所有的合作艺人以及参与者，确认他们的现状。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Reach every collaborating artist and participant from the show to confirm their current status.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一个也不能漏，不要只发信息。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not a single person may be missed, and do not merely send text messages.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我要听到他们亲自说话，或者见到他们本人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I need to hear them speak in person or have someone see them face to face.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，你的胃又疼了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao, is your stomach hurting again?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "给我拿一下药。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hand me my medicine.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "小谷你留守公司，盯住今天的天气情况。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, stay on duty here and keep a close watch on today's weather.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，我这就给你拿药。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Okay, let me get your medicine right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你知道老大病发的时候最不想见人，咱们赶快行动吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You know the boss hates being seen when his stomach flares up—let us move quickly.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "联系大使馆，动用欧洲所有关系，我要第一时间知道那边的状况。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我们的速度一定要比国内的新闻行动更快。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "好，我马上去办。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "联系节目所有的合作艺人以及参与者，确认他们的现状。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一个也不能漏，不要只发信息。",
      "gap": 0.5
